    "descriptionEn": "## Key Points\n\n- **Daily Obligation**: Gratitude for each of your 360 joints requires daily charity\n- **Diverse Forms**: Charity includes justice, helping others, kind words, and removing harm\n- **Accessible Acts**: Simple, everyday actions fulfill this obligation\n\n## Lessons Learned\n\n> \"Every blessing demands gratitude; every joint requires a daily act of goodness.\"\n\n1. Your body's blessings create obligations of thankfulness through good deeds\n2. Small acts of kindness and justice are valuable forms of charity\n3. Walking to prayer and speaking good words are acts of worship\n4. Making the world safer and better for others is charity\n\n## Practical Application\n\n- *Resolve disputes fairly and justly when asked to mediate*\n- *Offer physical help to those carrying burdens or struggling with tasks*\n- *Speak kind, beneficial words to everyone you encounter*\n- *Remove obstacles, litter, and hazards from pathways*\n- *Walk to the mosque for prayers to multiply your reward*",
